    "text": "Leofan men, us is mycel \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we w\u00e6re beon \u00fe\u00e6s egeslican timan \u00fee towerd is.\nNu bi\u00f0 swy\u00f0e ra\u00f0e Antecristes tima, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e we wenan magan & eac georne witan, & \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 se\nHe by\u00f0 sylf deofol & \u00f0eah mennisc man geboren.\nCrist is so\u00f0 God & so\u00f0 mann, & Antecrist bi\u00f0 so\u00f0lice deofol & mann.\n\u00d0urh Crist com eallum middanearde help & frofer, & \u00f0urh Antecrist cym\u00f0 se m\u00e6sta gryre & seo m\u00e6ste\nAnd eall mancynn forwurde for\u00f0rihte gif God his dagas ne gescyrte.\nAc God gescyrt his dagas for \u00f0\u00e6ra \u00feingan \u00fee him gecorene syn & he gehealden habban wile.\nAnd \u00f0eah on \u00feam f\u00e6ce \u00fee he bi\u00f0 he gede\u00f0 swa mycel to yfele swa n\u00e6fre \u00e6r ne gewear\u00f0.\n\u00c6lcne mann he wile awendan of rihtan geleafan & of cristendome & bespannan to his unlarum gif he\n& God hit ge\u00feafa\u00f0 him sume hwile for twam \u00feingum: an is \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6t men beo\u00f0 \u00feurh synna swa for\u00f0\nFor\u00f0am nis nan man \u00fe\u00e6t ne sy synful, & \u00e6lc man sceal sar \u00f0olian o\u00f0\u00feon her o\u00f0\u00feon elleshw\u00e6r be \u00f0am\nAnd \u00f0y bi\u00f0 seo ehtnes \u00feonne godum mannum swa sti\u00f0, for\u00f0am \u00fee hy sculon beon ra\u00f0e gecl\u00e6nsode &\n\u00d0a \u00f0e w\u00e6ron for\u00f0ferede for hund gearum o\u00f0\u00f0on gyt firnor, wel \u00fea magan beon nu gecl\u00e6nsode.\nWe motan nyde \u00fe\u00e6t sti\u00f0re \u00feolian, gyf we cl\u00e6ne beon sceolan \u00feonne se dom cym\u00f0, nu we \u00fe\u00e6ne fyrst\nBe\u00feence gehwa hine sylfne be \u00f0am \u00fee he wille, ne cym\u00f0 ure \u00e6fre \u00e6nig to Godes rice \u00e6r we beon \u00e6fre\nLeofan men, God ge\u00feafa\u00f0 \u00feam deofle Antecriste \u00fe\u00e6t he mot ehtan godra manna, for\u00f0am \u00fee hi sculon,\n\u00dea \u00feonne \u00fee his leasungum gelyfa\u00f0 & him to gebuga\u00f0, \u00feam he byrh\u00f0 her for worulde & \u00f0a he weor\u00fea\u00f0\nSe gesawenlica deofol wyrc\u00f0 fela wundra & seg\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he God sylfa beo, & mid his gedwimerum m\u00e6st\nGyf hi \u00f0onne \u00fe\u00e6t nella\u00f0, \u00feonne sculan hi ehtnessa mycle & eac earmlicne dea\u00f0 ge\u00f0olian.\nEala, ges\u00e6lig bi\u00f0 \u00feeah se \u00f0e to \u00feam anr\u00e6de bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he for\u00f0am ne awaca\u00f0; ac witodlice \u00fe\u00e6ra bi\u00f0 ealles\nUre Drihten Crist geh\u00e6lde fela \u00fe\u00e6ra on life \u00fee unhale w\u00e6ron, & se deofol Antecrist gebroca\u00f0 &\nAc sy\u00f0\u00f0an he \u00fe\u00e6ne mann gebrocod h\u00e6f\u00f0, sy\u00f0\u00fean he m\u00e6g don swylce he hine geh\u00e6le, gyf he geswic\u00f0\nHe bi\u00f0 eal unwrenca full.\n\u00d0onne beswic\u00f0 he swy\u00f0e fela manna \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t he gebroca\u00f0 m\u00e6nige man dihlice & geh\u00e6l\u00f0 eft\n\u00c6lc yfel he m\u00e6g don, & \u00e6lc he de\u00f0.\nHe de\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t fyr cym\u00f0 ufene, swylce hit of heofonum cume, & he mid \u00feam fela forb\u00e6rn\u00f0, ealswa he\nAc se \u00f0e for \u00fe\u00e6s fyres ege him to gebih\u00f0, he sceal aa on helle on ecan bryne wunian.\nNe can ic ne \u00e6fre \u00e6nig man o\u00f0rum asecgan fore ealne \u00feone egsan \u00fee \u00f0urh \u00fe\u00e6ne deofol on worulde\n\u00deonne age we mycle \u00feearfe \u00fe\u00e6t we God \u00e6lmihtigne georne biddan \u00fe\u00e6t he us gescylde wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ne egesan\nSe sylfa deofol \u00fee on helle is, \u00fe\u00e6t is se \u00fee \u00feonne wyr\u00f0 on \u00feam earmsceapenan men Antecriste & bi\u00f0\nWe agan \u00fey swy\u00f0e mycle \u00feearfe \u00fe\u00e6t we wi\u00f0 swylcne ege w\u00e6re beon & eac \u00fea warnian \u00fee swylc nyton\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t is gesyne, \u00fey is \u00f0eos woruld fram d\u00e6ge to d\u00e6ge wyrse & wyrse.\nEac ic secge to so\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t deofol wyle \u00e6lces mannes ge\u00f0anc, gyf he m\u00e6g, swy\u00f0e gelettan \u00fe\u00e6t he hit na\nLa, hw\u00e6t is se man on life buton hine God \u00e6lmihtig gehealde, & he \u00e6r gewarnod \u00fee bet sy, \u00fe\u00e6t he\nAc utan warnian us georne & geearnian to Gode \u00fe\u00e6t he us gescylde swa his willa sy.\nUton habban anr\u00e6dne geleafan & f\u00e6str\u00e6de ge\u00feanc to urum Drihtne.\n\u00deonne, \u00feeah hit gebyrige \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00fe\u00e6re yrm\u00f0e gebidan sculon & on \u00feisum life earfo\u00f0a adreogan, \u00feeah\nOn Godes naman ic bidde \u00fe\u00e6t cristenra manna gehwylc hine sylfne georne be\u00feence & geornlice to",
